                                "text": "Обалде́ть!",
                                "translation": "That's crazy!",
                                "english": "That's crazy!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f2decf6-a841-4899-90b8-03985c8f42a7",
                                "sense_id": "0544c30b-cee4-34fa-aea6-36ee57e1261d",
                                "text": "Обалде́ть, как он со мной флирту́ет.",
                                "translation": "It's crazy how much he flirts with me.",
